SOCIAL MEDIA PLATFORM - MONGODB

– Users Collection
Structure 
{ _id: ObjectId(), username: “username”,
email: “email@example.com”, createdAt: ISODate(), followers:
[ObjectId(), ObjectId()], following: [ObjectId(), ObjectId()] }

– Posts Collection (Embedded Comments and Likes) 
{ _id: ObjectId(),
userId: ObjectId(), content: “Post content”, createdAt: ISODate(),
likes: [ { userId: ObjectId(), likedAt: ISODate() } ], comments: [ {
userId: ObjectId(), text: “Comment text”, commentedAt: ISODate() } ] }

– Users with Most Followers
db.users.aggregate([ { $project: { username:
1, followerCount: { $size: "$followers” } } }, { $sort: { followerCount:
-1 } }, { $limit: 5 }])

– Posts with Highest Likes 
db.posts.aggregate([ { $project: { content:
1, likeCount: { $size: "$likes” }, commentCount: { $size: "$comments” }
} }, { $sort: { likeCount: -1 } }, { $limit: 5 }])

– Posts with Highest Comments
db.posts.aggregate([ { $project: {
content: 1, commentCount: { $size: "$comments” } } }, { $sort: {
commentCount: -1 } }, { $limit: 5 }])

– User Activity Over Time 
db.posts.aggregate([ { $group: { _id: { year:
{ $year: "$createdAt” }, month: { $month: "$createdAt” } }, totalPosts:
{ $sum: 1 } } }, { $sort: { “_id.year”: 1, “_id.month”: 1 } }])

ONLINE STORE / E-COMMERCE - MONGODB

– Products Collection 
{ _id: ObjectId(), name: “Product Name”, category:
“Category”, price: 1000, stock: 50 }

– Customers Collection 
{ _id: ObjectId(), name: “Customer Name”, email:
“customer@example.com”, joinedAt: ISODate() }

– Orders Collection (Embedded Items) 
{ _id: ObjectId(), customerId:
ObjectId(), orderDate: ISODate(), items: [ { productId: ObjectId(),
quantity: 2, price: 1000 } ], totalAmount: 2000 }

– Products with Embedded Reviews
{ _id: ObjectId(), name: “Product
Name”, category: “Category”, price: 1000, reviews: [ { customerId:
ObjectId(), rating: 5, comment: “Excellent product”, reviewDate:
ISODate() } ] }

– Top-Selling Products Per Category 
db.orders.aggregate([ {
$unwind: "$items” }, { $lookup: { from: “products”, localField:
“items.productId”, foreignField: “_id”, as: “productInfo” } }, {
$unwind: "$productInfo” }, {
$group: {  _id: {  category: "$productInfo.category”, product:
“$productInfo.name” }, totalSold: { $sum: "$items.quantity” } } }, {
$sort: { totalSold: -1 } }])

– Customer Purchase Patterns 
db.orders.aggregate([ {
$group: {  _id: "$customerId”, totalOrders: { $sum: 1 }, totalSpent: {
$sum: "$totalAmount” } } }, { $sort: { totalSpent: -1 } }])

– Monthly Revenue 
db.orders.aggregate([ { $group: { _id: { year: {
$year: "$orderDate” }, month: { $month: "$orderDate” } }, revenue: {
$sum: "$totalAmount” } } }, { $sort: { “_id.year”: 1, “_id.month”: 1 }
}])

– Yearly Revenue 
db.orders.aggregate([ { $group: { _id: { year: {
$year: "$orderDate” } }, revenue: { $sum: "$totalAmount” } } }, { $sort:
{ “_id.year”: 1 } }])

